WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.760
Hello guys and welcome back to yeagerists!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:11.360
In today's video, we will be going&nbsp;
through the story of Ymir Fritz.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.920
Leave a like on this video and subscribe to our&nbsp;
channel if you want to see more content like this!

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.640
around 2,000 years ago, Ymir's village&nbsp;
was attacked and enslaved by the Eldians,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:28.240
who also murdered her parents and&nbsp;
cut out the tongues of the survivors.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:32.400
One night, Ymir opened the gate to a&nbsp;
pen, allowing for some pigs to escape.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:37.520
Later, the tribe's ruler, Fritz,&nbsp;
questioned the slaves on the culprit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:41.680
The slaves pointed to Ymir, who was&nbsp;
released only to be hunted down for sport.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:47.200
Wounded and desperate, Ymir found an&nbsp;
unusually large tree with a chasm at its base.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:51.920
Seeking shelter, she stepped inside and,&nbsp;
not knowing of the sinkhole beneath,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.960
fell down into a pool of liquid. There,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:00.560
a mysterious spine-like creature fused with&nbsp;
her and turned her into the first Titan.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:06.160
With her newfound power, Ymir returned to serve&nbsp;
Fritz and used her Titan to cultivate the land,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:12.080
build bridges, and amass wealth for the Eldians.&nbsp;
Under his command, she also vanquished the armies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:17.920
of Eldia's rival, Marley. To "reward" Ymir for&nbsp;
her service, Fritz took her as his concubine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:23.680
and together, they had three children:&nbsp;
Maria, Rose, and Sheena. It was speculated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:27.680
that during this time, Ymir grew to&nbsp;
genuinely love and care for Fritz&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:32.960
despite his behavior and attitude towards her.
Thirteen years after acquiring the power of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:38.880
Titans, Ymir died while thwarting an assassination&nbsp;
attempt on Fritz, but then found herself in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:43.920
mysterious, barren land. King Fritz then forced&nbsp;
his daughters to eat their mother's corpse in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:49.360
an attempt to preserve the power of the Titans. He&nbsp;
commanded his daughters to continuously reproduce,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:53.920
to have their children eat their spines upon&nbsp;
their deaths, and perpetuate this ritual from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:59.760
child to child so that Ymir's blood would not die&nbsp;
out and Eldia could rule forever with its Titans.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:05.040
Ymir's power was divided into the Nine Titans;&nbsp;
and she continued to serve her descendants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.320
building them Titans whenever they&nbsp;
invoked the power of the Titans.&nbsp;

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:12.560
By the Eldians, Ymir's existence&nbsp;
is hailed as a god-given miracle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:17.840
The Restorationists claimed that she and all&nbsp;
Subjects of Ymir are "the chosen children of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:23.040
God" and that any atrocities Marley claims Eldia&nbsp;
had committed could not have been possible because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:28.240
Ymir would not have allowed it. There was even&nbsp;
an Eldian cult that worshiped Ymir as a goddess.&nbsp;

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:33.040
On the other hand, the Marleyans believe she&nbsp;
received her powers from a deal with the "Devil of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:37.920
All Earth" and used this to ostracize the Eldians.
There are also those who believe that Ymir&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.080
contacted the "source of all living&nbsp;
matter" to gain her power. This theory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:46.800
is relatively unheard of, as Grisha Yeager&nbsp;
was unaware of it until Eren Kruger told him.&nbsp;

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:52.560
Many centuries later, Frieda Reiss would visit her&nbsp;
half-sister Historia Reiss on the farm where she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:58.080
was raised. During some of her visits, Frieda told&nbsp;
Historia the story of Ymir's deal with the Devil;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:03.360
however, in the book she showed her, Ymir is&nbsp;
named "Krista". Frieda advised Historia that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:08.960
she must be lady-like, as "Krista" was. She&nbsp;
spoke of "Krista" as being an altruistic girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:14.560
and urged Historia to be loving and beloved like&nbsp;
her when she is grown. However, Historia did not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.640
remember these visits since Frieda used the&nbsp;
Founding Titan's power to erase her memories&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:24.320
after every visit. Historia would only recall&nbsp;
vague images of "Krista" in the years to come.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:32.080
While on the verge of death from Levi's Thunder&nbsp;
Spear, Zeke Yeager would awaken in an unknown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:36.160
land to discover Ymir resculpting&nbsp;
his damaged body with the earth.&nbsp;

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:40.800
During the assault on Shiganshina, Zeke and his&nbsp;
younger half-brother Eren Yeager are able to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:46.560
contact with each other and activate the Founder&nbsp;
before awakening in the Paths. As Ymir approaches,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:51.440
Eren notices her presence. Zeke explains&nbsp;
that she is in fact the Founder herself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:56.880
He then asks Eren to go ahead with the Euthanasia&nbsp;
Plan. Eren refuses and demands that Ymir lend him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:01.920
her strength, but his pleas are ignored. Zeke&nbsp;
subsequently reveals he has nullified the vow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:06.400
to renounce war through Ymir, who obeys&nbsp;
only the royal family, her descendants.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:11.520
She promptly restrains Eren with her chains.
After Zeke shows Eren the memories of their father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.240
Grisha, Zeke realizes that Eren was responsible&nbsp;
for Grisha's actions against the Reiss family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:21.520
and that his ultimate goal is inevitable. In a&nbsp;
panic, Zeke orders Ymir to sterilize the Subjects&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:26.560
of Ymir; and Ymir approaches the Coordinate&nbsp;
of converging paths to fulfill Zeke's will.&nbsp;

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:31.120
Eren manages to break free from his chains&nbsp;
and reach Ymir before Zeke. True to the Attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.640
Titan's yearning for freedom, he embraces&nbsp;
her and begs that she give him her power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:39.360
so that he can "end this world." He assures&nbsp;
her that he is not going to force her hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:43.920
recognizing that she is neither a slave nor&nbsp;
a god, but a human being with free will.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:49.440
Eren presents her with two options: to wander the&nbsp;
Paths forever, or help him with his plans. As Zeke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:54.400
desperately tries to stop them, Eren asks Ymir if&nbsp;
she was the one who called him to the Coordinate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:59.280
musing that she has been waiting 2000 years&nbsp;
for him to arrive. Ymir begins crying.&nbsp;

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:04.000
Back in Shiganshina, Eren's head reconnects&nbsp;
with his body. As everyone looks on in shock,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:08.880
the Wall crumbles, releasing a horde of&nbsp;
Colossus Titans as Eren forms a new Titan body.&nbsp;

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:13.520
As Eren converses with his friends in the Paths,&nbsp;
Ymir emerges next to Eren in the Coordinate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:17.280
symbolizing their cooperation.
As the Warrior unit along with members of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:22.320
Survey Corps engage numerous Titans on top of the&nbsp;
Founding Titan in an attempt to reach Eren at Fort&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:27.840
Salta, Ymir appears and is briefly seen by Armin&nbsp;
Arlert who speculates she is the one summoning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:32.880
the previous incarnations of the Nine Titans.
After Mikasa Ackerman swoops into the mouth of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:37.520
Eren's Titan, Ymir is shown to be standing&nbsp;
in the mouth, smiling as she watches Mikasa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:42.880
kiss Eren farewell after killing him.
Immediately afterward, Ymir relinquishes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:46.640
the Power of the Titans from the world.&nbsp;
Watching Mikasa kill the one she loves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:51.840
was enough to release Ymir from the love she had&nbsp;
for Fritz who only wanted to exploit her power.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:59.040
mir was the very first Titan and the only one to&nbsp;
ever possess the complete power of the Titans;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:03.760
all who come after her merely possess fragments&nbsp;
of her power. Her Titan body was immense,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:09.440
even by Titan standards, and easily towered above&nbsp;
the treeline. Using her immense strength, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:14.480
effortlessly wiped out Marley's forces. She was&nbsp;
also very skilled at controlling her Titan, as she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:18.720
performed complex tasks such as building bridges&nbsp;
across mountains and cultivating the fields.&nbsp;

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:24.720
It is said that nobody can surpass Ymir and that&nbsp;
because Ymir died 13 years after awakening her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:30.800
powers, no one is allowed to live beyond that;&nbsp;
this phenomenon is known as the "Curse of Ymir."&nbsp;

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:35.440
After Ymir's death, her spirit lived on&nbsp;
in a world where the Coordinate resides.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:39.920
She is responsible for all Titan transformations&nbsp;
throughout history: Whenever the power of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:44.320
Titans is invoked, she builds the Titan&nbsp;
bodies out of the otherworldly sand.[9]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:49.600
She is also responsible for regeneration and&nbsp;
re-sculpted Zeke's body after he was blown up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:54.800
It reportedly takes Ymir a very long time to&nbsp;
create these bodies: Zeke says it took her "years"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:58.960
to build him a single human body, but because&nbsp;
the world in which she lives transcends time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:03.520
the process was almost an instant in&nbsp;
the physical world. According to Zeke,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:08.560
Ymir can create anything, even chains that&nbsp;
represent the "vow of renouncing war."&nbsp;

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:12.480
Ymir is also the source of the Founding&nbsp;
Titan's power. From controlling other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.040
Titans to creating the Wall Titans to&nbsp;
altering the bodies of the Subjects of Ymir,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:22.400
all of the Founding Titan's feats are done by Ymir&nbsp;
after she is given the order, either by a scream&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:28.400
or in person through the world where Ymir resides.
However, because Ymir was Fritz's slave, she only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:34.240
listens to the commands of the royal family; thus,&nbsp;
only the royal family can use the Founder's power.&nbsp;

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:39.040
Eren Yeager became the exception to this,&nbsp;
as he invoked the Founder on two occasions.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:43.120
The first is when he punched Dina Fritz's&nbsp;
Pure Titan and commanded Ymir to make the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:48.240
surrounding Titans attack Dina; and after she&nbsp;
was killed, he turned them against Reiner Braun.&nbsp;

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.840
The second is when Eren convinced&nbsp;
Ymir that she has a will of her own,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:57.840
freeing her from the royal family's control,&nbsp;
and she lent her power to Eren instead of Zeke.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:01.920
Thank you guys so much for watching&nbsp;
this video, it really means a lot to us.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:08.160
We will see you guys very soon&nbsp;
in one of our next videos.

